  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Legacy OpenBuilds standard eccentric spacer with a 6 mm spacing height, for adjusting V-wheel contact on a linear-motion assembly.\n\nLegacy OpenBuilds design reference from the community-hosted mirage335 mirror of STEP Parts Library 1.5. The direct original STEP is retained unchanged, with OpenBuilds, LLC attribution and the recorded CC-BY-SA-4.0 license. This is not a current manufacturer-hosted download or a confirmed current hardware revision. No current SKU, price, stock or complete purchasable kit is inferred. Verify the chosen physical part and its manufacturer drawing before a fit-critical design. This is the standard 6 mm spacer, not the 0.25-inch (6.35 mm) part or the separate Mini Eccentric Spacer. Confirm the mating plate hole and cam geometry before use."
    }
  ],
